                        <i class="fa fa-list-ul text-primary mr-2"></i><span>加载中...</span> 的行动选项
                    </h3>
                    <ul id="options-list" class="space-y-1.5 text-secondary">
                        <li class="pl-3 py-1 text-sm"><i class="fa fa-spinner fa-spin mr-2"></i>加载选项中...</li>
